<div class="page-content">
    <h2>クラバト設定</h2>
    <p>当月(YYYYMM)のクラバト設定を Firebase に保存します。未作成の場合は前月の値をコピーして作成します。</p>

    <div id="cb-login-required" class="settings-login-required">
        Googleログイン後にクラバト設定を編集できます。
    </div>

    <div id="cb-firebase-error" class="settings-firebase-error" style="display: none;"></div>

    <div id="cb-settings" class="settings-card" style="display: none;">
        <div class="settings-row readonly">
            <label>対象年月(YYYYMM)</label>
            <span id="cb-yearmonth"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-grid-header">
            <span>ボス</span>
            <span>名前</span>
            <span>HP</span>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-grid-row">
            <span>1</span>
            <input id="cb-bossname-1" type="text" maxlength="100" placeholder="ボス名" />
            <input id="cb-bosshp-1" type="number" min="0" step="1" placeholder="HP" />
        </div>
        <div class="cb-grid-row">
            <span>2</span>
            <input id="cb-bossname-2" type="text" maxlength="100" placeholder="ボス名" />
            <input id="cb-bosshp-2" type="number" min="0" step="1" placeholder="HP" />
        </div>
        <div class="cb-grid-row">
            <span>3</span>
            <input id="cb-bossname-3" type="text" maxlength="100" placeholder="ボス名" />
            <input id="cb-bosshp-3" type="number" min="0" step="1" placeholder="HP" />
        </div>
        <div class="cb-grid-row">
            <span>4</span>
            <input id="cb-bossname-4" type="text" maxlength="100" placeholder="ボス名" />
            <input id="cb-bosshp-4" type="number" min="0" step="1" placeholder="HP" />
        </div>
        <div class="cb-grid-row">
            <span>5</span>
            <input id="cb-bossname-5" type="text" maxlength="100" placeholder="ボス名" />
            <input id="cb-bosshp-5" type="number" min="0" step="1" placeholder="HP" />
        </div>

        <div class="settings-row">
            <label for="cb-start-date">開始日</label>
            <input id="cb-start-date" type="date" />
        </div>

        <div class="settings-row">
            <label for="cb-end-date">終了日</label>
            <input id="cb-end-date" type="date" />
        </div>

        <div class="settings-actions">
            <button id="cb-save-button" class="btn btn-primary" disabled>保存</button>
            <span id="cb-status" class="settings-status"></span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
